138
00:08:57,160 --> 00:08:58,200
We think platonically.

139
00:08:58,200 --> 00:09:03,740
And my 24-year-old daughter has actually taught me what, well, actually, I think it's her generation.

140
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:09,040
So I'm talking to my daughter, and we're making plans, and she'll say, perfect.

141
00:09:09,040 --> 00:09:14,020
And I've come to the conclusion that's kind of a 20-something word now.

142
00:09:14,020 --> 00:09:17,920
Because I talked to two more 20-year-olds in the last two weeks.

143
00:09:17,920 --> 00:09:21,220
And in every case, when we made our plans, they said, perfect.

144
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:27,140
