147
00:09:34,040 --> 00:09:36,380
I'm not flirting with you.

148
00:09:36,380 --> 00:09:36,840
I'm scripted.

149
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:37,760
So I'm not flirting with you.

150
00:09:37,760 --> 00:09:39,840
My daughter's 24, and she says, perfect.

151
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:41,440
And she said, yes, I am.

152
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:43,940
You know, it's kind of like, is Bill Colaris here?

153
00:09:43,940 --> 00:09:45,720
I mean, you guys were groovy in your day.

154
00:09:48,820 --> 00:09:49,880
We were cool.

155
00:09:49,880 --> 00:09:51,740
Where's Dave?

156
00:09:51,740 --> 00:09:53,020
You guys were probably rad.

157
00:09:53,020 --> 00:09:55,080
Yeah, you guys were, well, not that Dave, the other Dave.

158
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:55,980
The Dave from Canvas.

159
00:09:55,980 --> 00:09:58,500
You were groovy, too.

160
00:09:58,500 --> 00:10:04,200
So I think the word here is perfect.

161
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:12,260
And it means adequate and just right for what we need today.

162
00:10:12,260 --> 00:10:15,920
That God will make you holy.

163
00:10:15,920 --> 00:10:18,300
Spirit.

164
00:10:19,520 --> 00:10:20,280
And soul.

165
00:10:20,280 --> 00:10:22,520
And body.

166
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:24,200
Completely.

167
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:25,060
Perfect.

168
00:10:25,060 --> 00:10:30,480
Without blame.

169
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:33,920
At the coming of the Lord Jesus Christ.

170
00:10:33,920 --> 00:10:36,980
And then here is our verse for today, or one of them.

