That God's plan is to make you more like Jesus.

185
00:11:20,440 --> 00:11:21,200
And he's faithful.

186
00:11:21,200 --> 00:11:23,600
He's faithful.

187
00:11:23,600 --> 00:11:24,360
Okay.

